  "foot": {
    "text": "After PREPARE and required data/LLC work, COMMIT(I) targets harts 0 and 1. Hart 0 ACKs; hart 1 does not. No timeout: the CCU keeps line X locked and slot T3 allocated, leaves the directory unchanged, and withholds the requester grant. Line Y may complete only when its slot and resources are independent. Reset is the only recovery and clears cache/directory valid state. Logical aliases, not finalized RTL ports; spacing is illustrative, not a latency bound."
  },
